{"id":"u02","level":"A1","emoji":"🔢","title":{"t":"Zahlen und Alter","s":"Numbers and age","a":"audio/de-en/1e3378068f96.mp3"},"goals":["Count from 0 to 20","Ask and say how old someone is","Ask and say where someone lives","Use regular verb endings: ich wohne, du wohnst, er wohnt"],"words":[{"id":"w01","t":"null","s":"zero","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Drei minus drei ist null.","s":"Three minus three is zero.","a":"audio/de-en/3321dcc32321.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/d64affe71fbc.mp3"},{"id":"w02","t":"eins","s":"one","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Eins plus eins ist zwei.","s":"One plus one is two.","a":"audio/de-en/13e41073b7be.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/c149e0caf636.mp3"},{"id":"w03","t":"zwei","s":"two","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Zwei plus zwei ist vier.","s":"Two plus two is four.","a":"audio/de-en/c6bd73b323d9.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/4eeae195f5cc.mp3"},{"id":"w04","t":"drei","s":"three","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Drei plus drei ist sechs.","s":"Three plus three is six.","a":"audio/de-en/a792634e614e.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/d20ca50168a9.mp3"},{"id":"w05","t":"vier","s":"four","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Vier plus vier ist acht.","s":"Four plus four is eight.","a":"audio/de-en/ff7126f4b4a1.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/4d7c2f226d37.mp3"},{"id":"w06","t":"fünf","s":"five","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Fünf minus eins ist vier.","s":"Five minus one is four.","a":"audio/de-en/d7f2863ea6e8.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/ff46947bdf52.mp3"},{"id":"w07","t":"sechs","s":"six","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Sechs plus drei ist neun.","s":"Six plus three is nine.","a":"audio/de-en/f8b5e4a010f0.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/41d7645ac5e8.mp3"},{"id":"w08","t":"sieben","s":"seven","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Sieben plus eins ist acht.","s":"Seven plus one is eight.","a":"audio/de-en/a3ee3984c462.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/bbdf99c13fc8.mp3"},{"id":"w09","t":"acht","s":"eight","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Acht minus zwei ist sechs.","s":"Eight minus two is six.","a":"audio/de-en/febce7c8f9a7.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/f78f80b74228.mp3"},{"id":"w10","t":"neun","s":"nine","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Neun minus vier ist fünf.","s":"Nine minus four is five.","a":"audio/de-en/347816adfbc0.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/a173a63ff654.mp3"},{"id":"w11","t":"zehn","s":"ten","emoji":"🔟","ex":{"t":"Fünf plus fünf ist zehn.","s":"Five plus five is ten.","a":"audio/de-en/be37641e5c9a.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f51f.svg","a":"audio/de-en/8173c9b74afd.mp3"},{"id":"w12","t":"das Jahr","pl":"die Jahre","s":"year","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Ich bin zwanzig Jahre alt.","s":"I'm twenty years old.","a":"audio/de-en/aea9ff95e94b.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/9d5b86a13cba.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/6ad00a5256f6.mp3"},{"id":"w13","t":"alt","s":"old","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Wie alt ist Lukas?","s":"How old is Lukas?","a":"audio/de-en/04bab3a39784.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/f35b0ed4d681.mp3"},{"id":"w14","t":"wohnen","s":"to live (in a place)","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Ich wohne in Köln.","s":"I live in Cologne.","a":"audio/de-en/b18496b01402.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/27c48ff185d5.mp3"}],"phrases":[{"id":"p01","t":"Wie alt bist du?","s":"How old are you? (informal)","a":"audio/de-en/c7e4eb590ad3.mp3"},{"id":"p02","t":"Wie alt sind Sie?","s":"How old are you? (polite)","a":"audio/de-en/29754874b3f3.mp3"},{"id":"p03","t":"Ich bin zwölf Jahre alt.","s":"I'm twelve years old.","a":"audio/de-en/1e760bff1c70.mp3"},{"id":"p04","t":"Wo wohnst du?","s":"Where do you live? (informal)","a":"audio/de-en/28501bb8433e.mp3"},{"id":"p05","t":"Ich wohne in Berlin.","s":"I live in Berlin.","a":"audio/de-en/195cfaf8b1b1.mp3"},{"id":"p06","t":"Wie viel ist drei plus vier?","s":"What is three plus four?","a":"audio/de-en/ae760e63ef32.mp3"},{"id":"p07","t":"Das ist richtig!","s":"That's right!","a":"audio/de-en/6a8c09779caa.mp3"},{"id":"p08","t":"Das ist falsch.","s":"That's wrong.","a":"audio/de-en/6dcc1c1b2710.mp3"}],"dialogue":{"title":{"t":"Neu in Köln","s":"New in Cologne","a":"audio/de-en/07b8cba9e369.mp3"},"speakers":{"A":{"name":"Lukas","voice":"m"},"B":{"name":"Neda","voice":"f"}},"lines":[{"sp":"A","t":"Hallo! Ich bin Lukas. Wie heißt du?","s":"Hi! I'm Lukas. What's your name?","a":"audio/de-en/3d30113d01c9.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Hallo, Lukas! Ich heiße Neda.","s":"Hi, Lukas! My name is Neda.","a":"audio/de-en/b484e83a783d.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Woher kommst du, Neda?","s":"Where are you from, Neda?","a":"audio/de-en/50b70f5d5a1f.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Ich komme aus dem Iran, aus Isfahan.","s":"I'm from Iran, from Isfahan.","a":"audio/de-en/0cb514424f7e.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Wie alt bist du?","s":"How old are you?","a":"audio/de-en/c7e4eb590ad3.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Ich bin zwölf Jahre alt. Und du?","s":"I'm twelve years old. And you?","a":"audio/de-en/27122ceea7cc.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Ich bin elf. Wo wohnst du?","s":"I'm eleven. Where do you live?","a":"audio/de-en/79ff819e5e5f.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Ich wohne hier in Köln. Und du?","s":"I live here in Cologne. And you?","a":"audio/de-en/e4dad3a5d4e8.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Ich wohne auch hier! Tschüss, Neda!","s":"I live here, too! Bye, Neda!","a":"audio/de-en/9d989beabe8b.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Tschüss, Lukas!","s":"Bye, Lukas!","a":"audio/de-en/27701c2a86a3.mp3"}]},"grammar":[{"id":"g01","title":{"t":"Zahlen 0–20 und Alter","s":"Numbers 0–20 and age"},"explain":"Learn **0–12** by heart. From 13 to 19, just say the small number and add **-zehn**: **drei + zehn = dreizehn**, **vier + zehn = vierzehn**.\nTwo small changes: **sechzehn** (no s) and **siebzehn** (no -en). Twenty is **zwanzig**.\nWhen you count, say **eins**. Before a noun, say **ein**: **ein Jahr**.\nTo talk about age, use **sein** + number + **Jahre alt**: **Ich bin zehn Jahre alt.** You can also just say **Ich bin zehn.**","table":[["0 null","7 sieben","14 vierzehn"],["1 eins","8 acht","15 fünfzehn"],["2 zwei","9 neun","16 sechzehn"],["3 drei","10 zehn","17 siebzehn"],["4 vier","11 elf","18 achtzehn"],["5 fünf","12 zwölf","19 neunzehn"],["6 sechs","13 dreizehn","20 zwanzig"]],"examples":[{"t":"Wie alt bist du? – Ich bin elf.","s":"How old are you? – I'm eleven.","a":"audio/de-en/a38c0520d3c3.mp3"},{"t":"Sara ist sechzehn Jahre alt.","s":"Sara is sixteen years old.","a":"audio/de-en/542b35f878a5.mp3"},{"t":"Das Baby ist ein Jahr alt.","s":"The baby is one year old.","a":"audio/de-en/96406412a143.mp3"},{"t":"Zwölf plus acht ist zwanzig.","s":"Twelve plus eight is twenty.","a":"audio/de-en/cb7364650b35.mp3"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","t":"Sieben plus acht ist ___.","options":["fünfzehn","sechzehn","siebzehn"],"answer":0,"s":"Seven plus eight is fifteen.","full":"Sieben plus acht ist fünfzehn.","a":"audio/de-en/c116c65e2a86.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Das Baby ist ___ Jahr alt.","options":["ein","eins","zwei"],"answer":0,"s":"The baby is one year old.","full":"Das Baby ist ein Jahr alt.","a":"audio/de-en/96406412a143.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Wie ___ bist du? – Ich bin neun.","options":["alt","viel","wo"],"answer":0,"s":"How old are you? – I'm nine.","full":"Wie alt bist du? – Ich bin neun.","a":"audio/de-en/ccd39b492903.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"Zehn plus sechs ist ___.","answer":["sechzehn","16"],"s":"Ten plus six is sixteen.","full":"Zehn plus sechs ist sechzehn.","a":"audio/de-en/65c221c14f4f.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"Neun plus drei ist ___.","answer":["zwölf","zwoelf","12"],"s":"Nine plus three is twelve.","full":"Neun plus drei ist zwölf.","a":"audio/de-en/159228921558.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"Ich bin zwölf Jahre alt.","s":"I'm twelve years old.","full":"Ich bin zwölf Jahre alt.","a":"audio/de-en/1e760bff1c70.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"Wie alt sind Sie?","s":"How old are you? (polite)","full":"Wie alt sind Sie?","a":"audio/de-en/29754874b3f3.mp3"}]},{"id":"g02","title":{"t":"Regelmäßige Verben: wohnen, lernen","s":"Regular verbs: wohnen, lernen"},"explain":"Most German verbs are regular. Take the infinitive, remove **-en**, and you have the stem: **wohnen → wohn-**.\nThen add the ending: ich wohn**e**, du wohn**st**, er/sie/es wohn**t**, Sie wohn**en**.\nThe same works for **kommen** and **lernen** (*to learn*): ich lerne, du lernst, sie lernt.\nOne small exception: **heißen** – du heißt (the ß already sounds like s, so you only add **-t**).","table":[["ich","wohne","lerne"],["du","wohnst","lernst"],["er / sie / es","wohnt","lernt"],["Sie","wohnen","lernen"]],"examples":[{"t":"Ich wohne in Köln.","s":"I live in Cologne.","a":"audio/de-en/b18496b01402.mp3"},{"t":"Wo wohnst du?","s":"Where do you live?","a":"audio/de-en/28501bb8433e.mp3"},{"t":"Anna wohnt in Berlin.","s":"Anna lives in Berlin.","a":"audio/de-en/c42e57aa3ce6.mp3"},{"t":"Reza lernt Deutsch.","s":"Reza is learning German.","a":"audio/de-en/4c4f723b4ac3.mp3"},{"t":"Wo wohnen Sie, Frau Müller?","s":"Where do you live, Ms. Müller?","a":"audio/de-en/1df21a8ddb59.mp3"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","t":"Wo ___ du?","options":["wohnst","wohnt","wohne"],"answer":0,"s":"Where do you live?","full":"Wo wohnst du?","a":"audio/de-en/28501bb8433e.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Anna ___ in Berlin.","options":["wohne","wohnst","wohnt"],"answer":2,"s":"Anna lives in Berlin.","full":"Anna wohnt in Berlin.","a":"audio/de-en/c42e57aa3ce6.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Ich ___ aus dem Iran.","options":["komme","kommst","kommt"],"answer":0,"s":"I'm from Iran.","full":"Ich komme aus dem Iran.","a":"audio/de-en/c9bcce588653.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"Ali ___ in Hamburg.","answer":["wohnt"],"s":"Ali lives in Hamburg.","full":"Ali wohnt in Hamburg.","a":"audio/de-en/15b9bd5306cf.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"Sara ___ Deutsch.","answer":["lernt"],"s":"Sara is learning German.","full":"Sara lernt Deutsch.","a":"audio/de-en/c0c6ba37b613.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"Ich wohne in Bonn. Du ___ in Köln.","answer":["wohnst"],"s":"I live in Bonn. You live in Cologne.","full":"Ich wohne in Bonn. Du wohnst in Köln.","a":"audio/de-en/ce76408e4ca9.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"Wo wohnen Sie?","s":"Where do you live? (polite)","full":"Wo wohnen Sie?","a":"audio/de-en/00a538b195a7.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"Maryam wohnt in Köln.","s":"Maryam lives in Cologne.","full":"Maryam wohnt in Köln.","a":"audio/de-en/3f30f22e2033.mp3"}]}],"reading":{"title":{"t":"Ich bin Amir","s":"I'm Amir","a":"audio/de-en/8cad29bb93ee.mp3"},"text":[{"t":"Hallo! Ich heiße Amir.","s":"Hi! My name is Amir.","a":"audio/de-en/b4e4546677e9.mp3"},{"t":"Ich bin zehn Jahre alt.","s":"I'm ten years old.","a":"audio/de-en/51d2307ecee2.mp3"},{"t":"Ich komme aus dem Iran, aus Isfahan.","s":"I'm from Iran, from Isfahan.","a":"audio/de-en/eabc25947363.mp3"},{"t":"Ich wohne in Köln.","s":"I live in Cologne.","a":"audio/de-en/b18496b01402.mp3"},{"t":"Ich lerne Deutsch.","s":"I'm learning German.","a":"audio/de-en/8c1327aa3c62.mp3"},{"t":"Lukas wohnt auch in Köln.","s":"Lukas lives in Cologne, too.","a":"audio/de-en/7f81530b68c9.mp3"},{"t":"Er ist elf Jahre alt.","s":"He is eleven years old.","a":"audio/de-en/d8a642faa22a.mp3"},{"t":"Er kommt aus Deutschland.","s":"He is from Germany.","a":"audio/de-en/dc32fa8a7516.mp3"}],"questions":[{"q":{"t":"Wie alt ist Amir?","s":"How old is Amir?","a":"audio/de-en/6bbb6f941253.mp3"},"options":["zehn","elf","zwölf"],"answer":0},{"q":{"t":"Wo wohnt Amir?","s":"Where does Amir live?","a":"audio/de-en/4fe42b00409e.mp3"},"options":["in Isfahan","in Köln","in Berlin"],"answer":1},{"q":{"t":"Wie alt ist Lukas?","s":"How old is Lukas?","a":"audio/de-en/04bab3a39784.mp3"},"options":["zehn","elf","zwanzig"],"answer":1},{"q":{"t":"Woher kommt Lukas?","s":"Where is Lukas from?","a":"audio/de-en/13374d3c4599.mp3"},"options":["aus dem Iran","aus Deutschland","aus Isfahan"],"answer":1}]},"sentences":[{"t":"Wie alt bist du?","s":"How old are you?","a":"audio/de-en/c7e4eb590ad3.mp3"},{"t":"Ich bin acht Jahre alt.","s":"I'm eight years old.","a":"audio/de-en/47c936dd4427.mp3"},{"t":"Sara wohnt in Hamburg.","s":"Sara lives in Hamburg.","a":"audio/de-en/b542a18eb2e9.mp3"},{"t":"Wo wohnen Sie?","s":"Where do you live? (polite)","a":"audio/de-en/00a538b195a7.mp3"},{"t":"Drei plus vier ist sieben.","s":"Three plus four is seven.","a":"audio/de-en/256c580567f5.mp3"},{"t":"Lukas kommt aus Berlin.","s":"Lukas is from Berlin.","a":"audio/de-en/458f90cf8fb4.mp3"},{"t":"Ich lerne Deutsch.","s":"I'm learning German.","a":"audio/de-en/8c1327aa3c62.mp3"}],"img":"img/e/1f522.svg"}